  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Syria Cross-border Humanitarian Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Syria Cross-border Humanitarian Fund (SCHF). The SCHF enables humanitarian partners, particularly Syrian organizations, to expand and support the delivery of humanitarian assistance across border and conflict lines. 

Gender is mainstreamed in OCHAs activitives including in the pooled funds.</narrative>
  </description>
